      {
        "text": "Martha \"Marti\" Deuter is the State Representative for Illinois' 45th District and took office in January 2025. She previously served 11 years on the Elmhurst City Council, focusing on public safety and local infrastructure. She also directed housing policy for the City of Chicago for eight years and worked for Bridge Communities, a homelessness nonprofit.",
